cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VLP Studio in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "VLP Studio"
abstract: >-
  Computational platform for designing virus-like particle (VLP) nanocapsules loaded with
  therapeutic enzymes, organised as a four-filter funnel: transport through the capsid pore,
  internal packing of the enzyme, de-immunisation, and survival under coarse-grained
  molecular dynamics. The driving use case is glucocerebrosidase for Gaucher disease.
type: software
